{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "707e17842f0e00f03631c6325acf9b3ad529b933a47f28cef55bdac30dd48152", "ja": "UNI-ON@IR!!!! 神戸公演\n『Princess STATION』DAY2を\n無事に終え、改めて気を引き締める\n事務員たちの一幕です。", "zh": "UNI-ON@IR!!!!神户公演\n『Princess STATION』DAY2\n圆满落幕后，事务员们重新振作精神、\n绷紧心弦的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_06_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "b001e7ed0add66b1d29278de67719d6864f678d6a784b31c8ab81cb4d84d3b34", "ja": "神戸公演も無事に終えることができました！\n二日間、お疲れ様でした～♪", "zh": "神户公演也顺利结束了！\n这两天辛苦大家了～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_06_1002_101kot", "source_sha256": "94685e33afdc3afd594c8bf6d4a7a066e6b54a1ce3a2bf19672bf7c7eed659e9", "ja": "お疲れさま、美咲ちゃん！　みんな可愛くて楽しくて、\nなんだかとってもプリンセスな公演だったわね！", "zh": "辛苦了，美咲！大家既可爱又开开心心的，\n总觉得真是一场特别有公主感觉的演出呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_06_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "43e905e4dbc31ae7123f8d9b7acd34524eac65206788d4530e86b8486e35b0e0", "ja": "はい！　みんな、と～ってもプリンセスでした♪", "zh": "好的！大家都超级～有公主风范呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_06_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "7b1755b927678ffe4e4428243e8db9d56f2e8d81f821b478a76f02797af353ff", "ja": "いつもと違う場所で、いつもと違う会場で。\nみんな、とっても緊張してるはずなのに……。", "zh": "在与平时不同的地方，在与平时不同的会场。\n大家明明都很紧张才对……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_06_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "ecf3b2356a825af7f86a93dc285bafd2b6c7a15ec3592ceb8ed8f891aedb634c", "ja": "ライブが始まったら、胸をはって、顔をあげて！\nすっごく楽しそうにステージで輝いて！", "zh": "演唱会开始后，要抬头挺胸！\n在舞台上闪耀出无比快乐的光芒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_06_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "213585641b4c65b63fa21758da9760beed0573736720b95eaf5531bcebdf182c", "ja": "本当に、女の子の憧れを集めたみたいなステージで……\n見ているだけで、胸がきゅんってしちゃいました♪", "zh": "真的就像汇集了女孩子们憧憬的舞台一样……\n光是看着，就让人心里怦怦直跳♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_06_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "f9ab013559e6e9ab532256ec1603793a4836235e851255df8fd2cccd77e4d05a", "ja": "今日で終わりかと思うと、ちょっぴり残念ですけど。\nその分、次の公演でみんなと一緒にがんばりたいです♪", "zh": "一想到今天就要结束了，还是有点遗憾呢。\n所以，我想在下一场公演里和大家一起努力♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_06_1008_101kot", "source_sha256": "110a4891449df9b725a8dce19f33f69c3768ed08971d19b0dccde120303778c2", "ja": "……なんて気持ちのこもった素敵コメントなの！？\n番組MCの経験、しっかりモノにしているのね♪", "zh": "……多么饱含感情的精彩发言啊！？\n你已经把节目主持人的经验好好掌握了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_06_1009_101kot", "source_sha256": "65a778c2bcd277f841e09fbedab81e6b5369ad60a0e1a28b67ab8d5502ab4ddd", "ja": "でも、そうなの。ひとつの公演の終わりは、\n新しい公演の幕開け……。それがライブツアー！", "zh": "不过，确实如此。一次公演的结束，\n就是新一次公演的开幕……这就是巡演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_06_1010_102mis", "source_sha256": "170ffa843398801df8f0e61984f225b01b240f1fc2195f98f3f94801f0e115fa", "ja": "それがライブツアー……！", "zh": "这就是巡演……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_06_1011_101kot", "source_sha256": "97bd8f6f44948c10182208802808e540f710776e62081012b315ce9257179d26", "ja": "というわけで、まだまだ終わりじゃないわ。\n最後まで、みんなで一緒にがんばりましょう！", "zh": "所以说，还远远没有结束呢。\n直到最后，大家一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_06_1012_102mis", "source_sha256": "67ef6d762207a6a45c48e6fca4599e03fd6ea234e4eeecd65d6af8fcabe6934f", "ja": "はいっ。\nよろしくお願いしますね、音無先輩♪", "zh": "好的。\n接下来也请多多关照，音无前辈♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_06_1013_101kot", "source_sha256": "bf1f2b5f6f3aaf0544d9b292024bb80eaaf23fb6e82c86a8d3a1b80722bea962", "ja": "それじゃ、そろそろ戻りましょうか。\nつもる話は打ち上げで、ね♪", "zh": "那么，我们也差不多该回去了吧。\n想聊的话就留到庆功宴上再聊吧，好吗♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
