{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_06_1016_101kot", "source_sha256": "253dea0df37285a450bc6653e77b84fc780f62e6b0ff747ef16382b4e2c44653", "ja": "こうしちゃいられないわ！　急ぎましょう美咲ちゃん！\n待ってなさい、神戸のお肉ー！！", "zh": "不能在这干耗着了！我们快走吧美咲！\n等着瞧吧，神户牛肉——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
